philosophers who fled Germany in the 1930s,

00:09:57.030 --> 00:10:03.670
went to teach at Columbia University, and
came up with this form of Marxism that is

00:10:03.670 --> 00:10:05.990
focused on American culture.

00:10:05.990 --> 00:10:11.440
It's you might think, well, Marxism is an
economic philosophy or a political philosophy.

00:10:11.440 --> 00:10:12.440
No.

00:10:12.440 --> 00:10:18.510
The idea is these Jewish individuals who fled
Germany in World War Two era came.

00:10:18.510 --> 00:10:24.960
Came to the U.S. and said, we are going to
use Marxism on American culture.

00:10:24.960 --> 00:10:31.520
And that's the kind of anti-Semitic element,
which oftentimes the people talking about

00:10:31.520 --> 00:10:38.330
cultural Marxism are also very suspicious
and concerned about the role of Jews in American

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.330
culture.

00:10:39.330 --> 00:10:46.140
