even know what they mean by it, and some of

00:10:46.140 --> 00:10:47.390
them don't.

00:10:47.390 --> 00:10:55.050
They mean that Jewish Marxists or left wing
Marxists are going to invade American culture

00:10:55.050 --> 00:11:06.170
by taking over media systems, education, schools,
universities, etc., and do bad things.

00:11:06.170 --> 00:11:10.050
And it's all going to be terrible is more
or less the the gist of it.

00:11:10.050 --> 00:11:11.670
So that's cultural Marxism.

00:11:11.670 --> 00:11:17.490
